    "body": "Seems useful but bundling node would likely more than double our binary size, but in general I am in favor.\n\nI think GitHub runs all node actions with this separate node version so it works deterministically, regardless what the image has installed.\n\nIf we do it we should have a mechanism to bundle exactly the same node version that github has, via some auto-update cron.",
